        <head>HOCKEY.</head>
        <p>HOCKEY.</p>
        <p>LATCETFORD.</p>
        <p>The First Team v. Manchester University at Fallow- field this afternoon is :—T Dixon, goal ; P Allanson, W 11 Pickles, backs ; F W Isherwood, .1 B Wilkinson, A Knight, halves ; R A Dale, J Pearson, D Travis, E Laver, A Starkey, forwards. Train from Central 1-5-5 p.m. The Second Team v. Manchester University " A" at Latchford is t—H Wright, goal; it Walsh, It Parkinson, backs ; H T Gibbs, A Bradshaw, T Banks, halves ; Hit Colon, H Pletcher, W Fletcher, W H Minards, C Hackney, forwards. Bully-off 2.15 p.m.</p>
