        <p>It is not temporary relief that tl:e anxious sufferer from kidney disease seeks—though even temporary relief from tke misery of backache, urinary disorders, dropy nrd rheumatism, would he welcome enough. What is sought is a lasting cure—and that is what is so encourag- ing abeut !Joan's Backache Kidney Pills—the patients are cured to STAYED CURED.</p>
