        <p>Rarely has so much interest ever been aroused as that caused by the discovery of a wonderfully simple cure for deafness and head noises. It has proved so remarkably successful even in the worst forms of Chronic deafne.ts, that the Discoverer will gladly send a free trial to any sufferer who mentions this Paper and encloses Id. stamp to cover p3stage. Address :--Elmer Shirley (Dept. 838), 6, Gt. James Street, Bedford Row, London, W.C.</p>
