        <p>COUNTY BOROUGH OF WARRINGTON.— TENDERS are invited for the supply of UNIFORM CLOTHING, HATS Scc.. to the several departments of the Corporation for the ensuing twelve months. Particulars, &amp;c., may be obtained on and after Monday next, the 12th inst., from the Borough Treasurer, Bank House, Sankey-street, and tenders, securely fastened, and endorsed " Tenders for Clothing" should be tent in to the undersigned, not later than 12 o'clock noon on the 21st February, 1912. The Contractor whose tender is accepted will be required to observe the recognised customs aad con- ditions as to the rate of wages and working hours prevailing within the district. The lowest or any tender not necessarily accepted. Municipal Offices, JOHN FAIRHURST, Warrington. Borough Treasurer. 9th February, 1912.</p>
